        <mxCell id="st" value="PostgreSQL is authoritative. Browsing is public; authentication begins at the hold request (ADR-014). 5-minute hold, max 8 seats, no extension. Payment policy per ADR-015/016/017." style="text;html=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
