        <mxCell id="legend" value="BPMN legend

  ellipse        start, intermediate and end event
  rounded box    task
  diamond        exclusive gateway
  hexagon        event-based wait
  dashed arrow   message flow between pools
  solid arrow    sequence flow or internal handoff
  red / amber    exception, cancellation or refund path" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;dashed=1;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="2260" width="2100" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="open_note" value="Policy status

PD-01 to PD-10 were resolved on 2026-08-10 (ADR-015, ADR-016, ADR-017), so payment timeout, callback precedence, post-failure retry, the cancellation boundary, showtime-cancellation effects and admin authority are all Accepted and implementable.

Still open, neither blocking a slice: D14 (QR payload detail and rotation) and D20 (named approvers per governance role). Hall and seat versioning after publication is open before destructive catalogue edits.

Red and amber elements are exception, cancellation and refund paths — not gated work." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;dashed=1;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2260" y="2260" width="2360" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
